{"unit_id":"DylanYeung0929__dsh-session-bridge#card-zh","repo":"DylanYeung0929/dsh-session-bridge","commit":"0ec3c154638f896d77a942f7c43c5c24d7e66688","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-bridge 是面向 DSH 的跨会话工具插件与命令行程序，可在终端或 DSH 工具调用中查看和操作本机其他会话。插件注册 session_list、session_read、session_send 和 session_chat 四项工具，分别用于列出会话、读取磁盘转录、向指定会话发送消息，以及围绕固定会话连续交流。配套 dshctl CLI 还提供实时跟随与会话焦点管理。适合需要从当前会话查看其他会话进度、读取历史内容或派发消息的 DSH 用户。运行需要 Python 3；读取压缩转录需要 zstd，插件通过本地桌面 App RPC 工作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:65","lib/index.mjs:188","tools/dshctl.py:1"]}
{"unit_id":"DylanYeung0929__dsh-session-bridge#card-en","repo":"DylanYeung0929/dsh-session-bridge","commit":"0ec3c154638f896d77a942f7c43c5c24d7e66688","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-bridge links DSH sessions through four tools: session_list lists conversations, session_read reads transcripts, session_send sends prompts, and session_chat continues a focused exchange. Its CLI supports live following. Requires Python 3; zstd is needed for compressed transcripts.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:65","lib/index.mjs:188","tools/dshctl.py:1"]}
