{"unit_id":"DylanYeung0929__dsh-session-bridge#feature-read","repo":"DylanYeung0929/dsh-session-bridge","commit":"0ec3c154638f896d77a942f7c43c5c24d7e66688","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-bridge 的功能「读取记录」：session_read 按会话 ID 或唯一标题匹配读取最近若干条磁盘转录；标题匹配有歧义时会报错并列出候选。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:82"]}
{"unit_id":"DylanYeung0929__dsh-session-bridge#feature-send","repo":"DylanYeung0929/dsh-session-bridge","commit":"0ec3c154638f896d77a942f7c43c5c24d7e66688","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-bridge 的功能「发送消息」：session_send 将指定文本追加到选定会话并触发该会话运行一轮，可选择排队或 steer 当前轮次，也可等待完成。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:99"]}
